269
00:15:24,733 --> 00:15:25,733
I definitely like her.

270
00:15:26,267 --> 00:15:28,667
There are so many moments

271
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,433
when I feel

272
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:34,367
