686
00:31:22,633 --> 00:31:24,300
You’re underestimating me again

687
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:26,300
Here, have some soup first

688
00:31:27,367 --> 00:31:28,700
I don’t look like it, do I?

689
00:31:32,633 --> 00:31:33,733
If your head hurts, want me to give you a massage?

690
00:31:33,733 --> 00:31:34,800
Would that help?

691
00:31:34,800 --> 00:31:37,200
The pain just comes on all of a sudden

692
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:37,500
It’s fine

693
00:31:37,500 --> 00:31:39,400
I didn’t wash my hair today anyway, so no need for a massage

694
00:31:40,267 --> 00:31:42,167
I really wanted to make myself get up today

695
00:31:42,167 --> 00:31:43,233
and wash my hair

696
00:31:43,633 --> 00:31:45,433
It’s okay, just try to hold on for a few more days

697
00:31:45,433 --> 00:31:47,333
If you shower now,

698
00:31:48,467 --> 00:31:49,067
it might make things worse

699
00:31:49,067 --> 00:31:49,800
Right

700
00:31:49,800 --> 00:31:51,500
So don’t stress about it, alright?

701
00:31:52,300 --> 00:31:54,133
To me, you’re always perfect

702
00:31:54,133 --> 00:31:55,200
And then you just

703
00:31:56,700 --> 00:31:57,767
have that filter

704
00:31:57,767 --> 00:31:59,567
But not everyone sees you through that filter

705
00:32:01,100 --> 00:32:02,733
Don’t worry, everyone sees the best in you

706
00:32:12,733 --> 00:32:13,633
Over here!

707
00:32:20,067 --> 00:32:21,333
I finally got on the bus!

708
00:32:22,200 --> 00:32:23,633
I'm chilled to the bone.

709
00:32:25,467 --> 00:32:27,000
It's fine, you can just stay in the car.

710
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:28,167
I'll go grab the report for you.

711
00:32:28,167 --> 00:32:29,533
If the result is positive or negative,

712
00:32:29,533 --> 00:32:30,633
what should we do?

713
00:32:30,633 --> 00:32:32,167
How about I call up to you from downstairs?

714
00:32:32,167 --> 00:32:33,033
Alright, then.

715
00:32:33,467 --> 00:32:34,800
I really need to warm up for a while.

716
00:32:34,800 --> 00:32:36,167
Yeah, just stay in the car.

717
00:32:36,167 --> 00:32:37,100
Just let me out here.

718
00:32:37,100 --> 00:32:39,400
And let her stay in the car for now.

719
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:41,067
Okay, hurry up and close the door.

720
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,167
Quick, close the door.

721
00:32:43,167 --> 00:32:44,433
So the wind doesn't get in.

722
00:32:44,433 --> 00:32:45,433
Yeah.

723
00:32:55,467 --> 00:32:56,300
Hi

724
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:58,000
The report is ready

725
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,100
Could you take a look for me?

726
00:33:00,233 --> 00:33:01,767
She’s feeling really unwell at the moment

727
00:33:01,767 --> 00:33:02,567
Is there anything else she can take besides cold medicine?

728
00:33:02,567 --> 00:33:04,167
Is there anything else she can take besides cold medicine?

729
00:33:04,167 --> 00:33:04,633
One more thing

730
00:33:04,633 --> 00:33:06,067
I’m not asking about how to take this medicine

731
00:33:06,067 --> 00:33:06,567
You mean this list, right?

732
00:33:06,567 --> 00:33:07,800
Yeah, everything’s listed there

733
00:33:20,100 --> 00:33:21,433
How are you feeling?

734
00:33:21,433 --> 00:33:22,100
It's nothing serious.

735
00:33:22,100 --> 00:33:23,333
Your prescriptions are ready.

736
00:33:27,100 --> 00:33:28,633
So I just need to take the medicine, right?

737
00:33:28,633 --> 00:33:29,300
Yes.

738
00:33:29,667 --> 00:33:31,633
It's nothing to worry about, but you might feel a bit dizzy with this one.

739
00:33:31,633 --> 00:33:32,600
Let me go over it with you.

740
00:33:33,367 --> 00:33:34,267
There's one to help with your cough.

741
00:33:34,267 --> 00:33:35,633
And another one

742
00:33:36,633 --> 00:33:37,667
to help clear phlegm.

743
00:33:37,667 --> 00:33:38,633
Take one pill twice a day.

744
00:33:38,633 --> 00:33:39,633
One pill each time.

745
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,133
Thanks.

746
00:34:07,633 --> 00:34:09,033
Such a lazy day.

747
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,300
Have a good rest.

748
00:34:10,300 --> 00:34:12,067
It just means your body wants you to rest.

749
00:34:12,067 --> 00:34:13,133
That's why you feel this way.

750
00:34:13,133 --> 00:34:14,167
Isn't that right?

751
00:34:14,167 --> 00:34:15,167
Alright.

752
00:34:15,167 --> 00:34:16,467
Why don't you play by yourself for a while?

753
00:34:17,200 --> 00:34:18,200
Go play on your own for a bit.

754
00:34:27,733 --> 00:34:29,200
Hold on a second, driver.

755
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,133
Zip up.

756
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,800
Alright, thanks.

757
00:34:41,433 --> 00:34:42,367
Okay, let's go.

758
00:34:47,733 --> 00:34:48,667
No rush.

759
00:34:49,733 --> 00:34:51,533
The fever's already making me dizzy.

760
00:34:52,033 --> 00:34:53,200
I know you must have a really high fever right now.

761
00:34:53,200 --> 00:34:54,600
It's making me a bit woozy.

762
00:34:58,667 --> 00:35:00,000
Don't worry about changing your slippers right now.

763
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,533
How about I bring them up for you?

764
00:35:02,033 --> 00:35:04,167
All these little things...

765
00:35:04,167 --> 00:35:06,633
He's so meticulous.

766
00:35:07,067 --> 00:35:08,567
I really feel out of it when I walk.

767
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,367
Where's your cold medicine, kiddo?

768
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:16,233
What's wrong, Xia Zhiguang?

769
00:35:16,233 --> 00:35:17,367
He calls her "kiddo."

770
00:35:17,367 --> 00:35:18,667
It's a nickname.

771
00:35:18,667 --> 00:35:20,000
It seems like, when you like someone,

772
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,667
it's easy to treat her like a little kid.

773
00:35:21,667 --> 00:35:22,533
Yeah.

774
00:35:23,100 --> 00:35:24,800
Where's your cold medicine?

775
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:25,800
The one I gave you last night.

776
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:27,267
It's over there.

777
00:35:30,167 --> 00:35:31,067
You can open the window.

778
00:35:31,067 --> 00:35:32,533
But could you move in a bit?

779
00:35:34,667 --> 00:35:36,033
I feel really awful.

780
00:35:44,233 --> 00:35:45,633
Look, I’ve washed my hands.

781
00:35:45,633 --> 00:35:47,100
Alright, I’ve washed my hands.

782
00:35:47,100 --> 00:35:48,067
This is so important.

783
00:35:48,067 --> 00:35:48,467
Right.

784
00:35:48,467 --> 00:35:50,433
He’s so detail-oriented.

785
00:35:50,433 --> 00:35:51,600
Exactly.

786
00:36:00,367 --> 00:36:01,100
It's so cold.

787
00:36:03,100 --> 00:36:04,067
Listen to me now.

788
00:36:04,067 --> 00:36:05,333
And don't worry about anything.

789
00:36:06,267 --> 00:36:08,000
Just wrap yourself in a thick blanket and get some sleep.

790
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:08,800
Alright?

791
00:36:09,233 --> 00:36:10,500
You get some rest first.

792
00:36:10,500 --> 00:36:11,533
I'll lie down for a bit too.

793
00:36:11,533 --> 00:36:13,133
Please try to get some sleep, okay?

794
00:36:13,133 --> 00:36:13,800
Go to sleep.

795
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:14,800
Okay.

796
00:36:24,233 --> 00:36:24,767
Guo Guo

797
00:36:24,767 --> 00:36:25,800
Come on in.

798
00:36:28,233 --> 00:36:29,367
I'm going to hang my clothes here.

799
00:36:29,367 --> 00:36:31,167
If you feel like going downstairs to eat later,

800
00:36:31,167 --> 00:36:32,033
I'll be downstairs the whole time.

801
00:36:32,033 --> 00:36:33,233
Don't worry, I'll stay downstairs.

802
00:36:33,333 --> 00:36:35,200
If you want to

803
00:36:35,200 --> 00:36:36,233
go down to eat,

804
00:36:36,233 --> 00:36:37,167
just go whenever you want.

805
00:36:37,167 --> 00:36:38,600
I'll be downstairs the whole time, alright?

806
00:36:39,167 --> 00:36:40,533
And if you want some fruit or anything else,

807
00:36:40,533 --> 00:36:41,500
it's all downstairs.

808
00:36:41,500 --> 00:36:42,667
Tonight, before bed,

809
00:36:42,667 --> 00:36:43,600
you can sleep until

810
00:36:44,067 --> 00:36:45,800
I think maybe eleven or twelve o'clock,

811
00:36:46,433 --> 00:36:48,500
or even one or two, that's totally fine.

812
00:36:48,500 --> 00:36:50,167
I'll come up later to give you your medicine.

813
00:36:51,367 --> 00:36:52,167
Okay.

814
00:36:55,300 --> 00:36:57,067
Alright, go ahead and turn off all the lights.

815
00:36:57,067 --> 00:36:57,267
Okay.

816
00:36:57,267 --> 00:36:58,100
Thanks.

817
00:36:58,100 --> 00:36:58,800
Good night.

818
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:12,467
I actually need to start with a blue base.

819
00:37:12,467 --> 00:37:13,467
And then I add the trees at the end, right?

820
00:37:13,467 --> 00:37:14,600
Right.

821
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:15,333
Alright.

822
00:37:18,100 --> 00:37:18,800
I've leveled up.

823
00:37:19,367 --> 00:37:21,100
Just two drawings and you've already improved!

824
00:37:21,267 --> 00:37:22,133
We all know how to draw now.

825
00:37:23,067 --> 00:37:23,700
Yeah, pretty much.

826
00:37:25,267 --> 00:37:26,667
Alright.

827
00:37:27,567 --> 00:37:29,100
That's about it. Let's leave it like this.

828
00:37:29,100 --> 00:37:30,100
Let's add a bit more here.

829
00:37:30,100 --> 00:37:30,333
Where?

830
00:37:30,333 --> 00:37:32,167
Right here, add some white.

831
00:37:32,167 --> 00:37:33,600
Add white here.

832
00:37:34,733 --> 00:37:36,200
Go get changed.

833
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:37,167
