1512
00:59:42,700 --> 00:59:43,300
Can I have a bite?

1513
00:59:43,300 --> 00:59:44,167
I just finished eating

1514
00:59:44,167 --> 00:59:45,033
Go ahead, have a little

1515
00:59:45,033 --> 00:59:46,133
I can't eat much more

1516
00:59:46,133 --> 00:59:47,800
In the end, what I realized was

1517
00:59:47,800 --> 00:59:49,567
If you ever had good feelings for this person

1518
00:59:49,567 --> 00:59:52,067
If you ever had good feelings for this person

1519
00:59:52,067 --> 00:59:53,533
That's the most important thing you got out of it

1520
00:59:53,533 --> 00:59:54,233
Yeah

1521
00:59:54,233 --> 00:59:54,800
That's it

1522
00:59:54,800 --> 00:59:56,733
Spending time together was really enjoyable

1523
00:59:56,733 --> 00:59:57,400
That's right

1524
00:59:57,400 --> 00:59:59,400
There's no need to focus on the unhappy moments

1525
00:59:59,400 --> 01:00:00,733
After all, there were happy times too

1526
