So, it's probably just the four of us, then.

1530
01:00:09,700 --> 01:00:10,733
What are you guys up to?

1531
01:00:11,200 --> 01:00:12,267
Playing badminton.

1532
01:00:12,467 --> 01:00:13,267
Just the two of us.

1533
01:00:15,200 --> 01:00:15,667
You two?

1534
01:00:17,000 --> 01:00:18,300
Aren't you playing badminton too?

1535
01:00:19,533 --> 01:00:20,667
Aren't you also playing?

1536
01:00:21,100 --> 01:00:21,633
No worries.

1537
01:00:22,033 --> 01:00:22,700
Way to go, Mr. Luo!

1538
01:00:24,633 --> 01:00:26,000
I've got your back, bro.

1539
