I just invited the people who were there yesterday.

1542
01:00:29,367 --> 01:00:31,467
So, I guess whoever was there can come, right?

1543
01:00:31,467 --> 01:00:32,733
Then come join us!

1544
01:00:32,733 --> 01:00:33,633
Come on!

1545
01:00:35,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Hey, Su Yonghao.

1546
01:00:36,800 --> 01:00:37,633
What do you want to do tomorrow?

1547
