Should we plan ahead?

1548
01:00:39,000 --> 01:00:39,433
Yeah.

1549
01:00:39,433 --> 01:00:40,767
Like, maybe we could go a bit earlier.

1550
01:00:40,767 --> 01:00:42,400
And then go play some badminton.

1551
01:00:42,400 --> 01:00:45,000
Or do something else together as a group.

1552
01:00:45,000 --> 01:00:46,167
I think that'd be a lot of fun.

1553
01:00:46,167 --> 01:00:47,167
Yeah.

1554
01:00:49,267 --> 01:00:50,633
