1569
01:01:11,700 --> 01:01:12,200
No problem.

1570
01:01:12,200 --> 01:01:13,600
Why don't we all go together?

1571
01:01:13,600 --> 01:01:14,200
Okay.

1572
01:01:14,200 --> 01:01:14,767
Alright.

1573
01:01:14,767 --> 01:01:16,400
Grab your book and join us.

1574
01:01:16,400 --> 01:01:17,300
